<view class="view center-view"><text class="center-title">学习中心</text><view class="score-card"><view class="score-num"><image class="coin-ico" src="{{a}}" mode="aspectFit"/><text>{{b}}</text></view><text class="score-label">学习金币</text></view><view class="block"><text class="bl-h3">金币兑换</text><text class="hint">每答对一题得 1 枚金币，攒够了就能换下面的奖励啦，换之前记得先和爸爸妈妈说一声。</text><view class="gift-list"><view wx:for="{{c}}" wx:for-item="g" wx:key="e" class="gift"><text class="g-name">{{g.a}}</text><view class="g-cost"><text>{{g.b}}</text><image class="g-coin" src="{{d}}" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="{{['btn', 'sm', 'primary', g.c && 'disabled']}}" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="{{g.d}}">兑换</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{e}}" class="redeemed"><text>已兑换：{{f}}</text></view></view></view>